**Summary of Fix:**  
- Added `hideAllLabels` and `showAllLabels` helpers.
- When collapsing a subprocess, all child labels are hidden.
- When expanding, all child labels are shown (and empty ones are hidden by `hideEmptyLabels`).

This will ensure that labels inside a collapsed subprocess are not visible, fixing the bug as described and shown in the GIF.
